T["Chance on hit: Your attacks have a high chance to poison the target for 8 Nature damage every 3 sec for 9 sec."] = "Может сработать при попадании: Ваши атаки с высокой вероятностью отравляют цель, нанося 8 ед. урона от сил природы каждые 3 сек. в течение 9 сек."
T["Claim your reward from Hydraxis' Coffer."] = "Заберите свою награду из Hydraxis' Coffer."
T["Collect 10 Al'Aketh Cultist's Ears from the Al'Aketh cultists in Shadowgale Forest, the Shine of Akir, or Gustberry Lowlands."] = "Соберите 10 Al'Aketh Cultist's Ears с культистов Al'Aketh в Shadowgale Forest, Shine of Akir или Gustberry Lowlands."
T["Collect 10 Al'Aketh Windstone Charms from Al'Aketh cultists found north of Valanaar at the Gustberry Fields or Shrine of Akir."] = "Соберите 10 Al'Aketh Windstone Charms с культистов Al'Aketh к северу от Valanaar — на Gustberry Fields или у Shrine of Akir."
T["Collect 10 Bloodied Insignias and take them to General Marcus Jonathan in Stormwind City."] = "Соберите 10 Bloodied Insignias и отнесите их персонажу General Marcus Jonathan в городе {z:Stormwind City}."
T["Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there."] = "Соберите 10 Water Elemental Cores с Sea Elementals и Sea Sprays на Forgotten Coast (локация: {z:Feralas}) и принесите их персонажу Zorbin Fandazzle — он находится там же, у причала."
T["Collect 12 pieces of Sturdy Lumber from Shadowvale in Tirisfal Glades."] = "Соберите 12 штук Sturdy Lumber в Shadowvale (локация: {z:Tirisfal Glades})."
T["Collect 25 Intact Limbs within The Ruins of Lordaeron for Morbin Lightbane in the Undercity."] = "Соберите 25 Intact Limbs в локации {z:Ruins of Lordaeron} для Morbin Lightbane в городе {z:Undercity}."
T["Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul."] = "Соберите 25 Ogre Warbeads с огров в подземельях {z:Dire Maul} или {z:Blackrock Spire} и вернитесь к Falrin Treeshaper в Athenaeum (подземелье {z:Dire Maul})."
T["Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace."] = "Соберите 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings для Willow в локации {z:Desolace}."
T["Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.At a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.Bring 5 Broken Tools to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village."] = "Соберите 5 Prospector's Picks. У кузнечного горна разбейте Prospector's Picks, чтобы получить Broken Tools. Принесите 5 Broken Tools персонажу Baine Bloodhoof в Bloodhoof Village."
T["Collect 6 Azure Feathers and 6 Bronze Feathers, and bring them to Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff."] = "Соберите 6 Azure Feathers и 6 Bronze Feathers и принесите их персонажу Eyahn Eagletalon в городе {z:Thunder Bluff}."
T["Collect 6 Fine Crab Chunks for Gubber Blump in Auberdine."] = "Соберите 6 Fine Crab Chunks для Gubber Blump в Auberdine."
T["Collect 6 Giant Crocolisk Skins and bring them to James Halloran in Menethil Harbor."] = "Соберите 6 Giant Crocolisk Skins и принесите их персонажу James Halloran в Menethil Harbor."
T["Collect 6 Scrawny Ursera Claws from Scrawny Ursera in Thendal Grove."] = "Соберите 6 Scrawny Ursera Claws со Scrawny Ursera в Thendal Grove."
T["Collect 6 Stonetalon Supplies from Pridewing Wyverns and deliver them to Innkeeper Faralia."] = "Соберите 6 Stonetalon Supplies с Pridewing Wyverns и доставьте их персонажу Innkeeper Faralia."
T["Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella."] = "Соберите 8 Fel Moss и принесите их персонажу Tarindrella."
T["Collect the Highly Toxic Strain from Witherfang in Ruins of Lordaeron for Theodore Griffs in Undercity."] = "Добудьте Highly Toxic Strain у Witherfang в локации {z:Ruins of Lordaeron} для Theodore Griffs в городе {z:Undercity}."
T["Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post."] = "Соберите для Locke Okarr в локации {z:Splintertree Post} припасы Warsong: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil и Warsong Axe Shipment."
T["Collect the missing pages from The Green Hills of Stranglethorn manuscript. Once all four chapters are complete, return them to Barnil."] = "Соберите недостающие страницы рукописи The Green Hills of Stranglethorn. Когда все четыре главы будут собраны, принесите их персонажу Barnil."
T["Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\"."] = "Commander Mar'alith в Cenarion Hold (локация: {z:Silithus}) просит вас найти его возлюбленную Natalia. Судя по собранным вами сведениям, Mistress Natalia Mar'alith следует искать на юге, в Hive'Regal. Прежде чем отправиться в улей, не забудьте навестить дворфов в лагере Bronzebeard. Возможно, у них найдётся для вас дополнительная работа и советы. И, &lt;name&gt;, помните слова командира: «Делайте то, что должны...»."
T["Confront Belthaan Brightwish along the road to the Shrine of Akir."] = "Бросьте вызов Belthaan Brightwish на дороге к Shrine of Akir."
T["Costs Honor Points and tokens (Marks of Honor). The seller is not listed on Wowhead yet."] = "Цена: очки чести и знаки (Marks of Honor). Продавец пока не указан на Wowhead."
