T["Reward from the quest 'To Valanaar'. Starts with Constable Aonda in Zephras Isle. Objective: Deliver Aonda's Written Report to Valennia Stormfist in Valanaar."] = "Награда за задание «{q:To Valanaar}». Задание выдаёт Constable Aonda, локация: {z:Zephras Isle}. Цель: Доставьте Aonda's Written Report персонажу Valennia Stormfist в Valanaar."
